CORE
a.c
b.c --change-impact --compact-output
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^- .* 3$
^\+ .* 3$
^D .* 4$
--
^warning: ignoring
\*\* helper \*\*
//
// --compact-output omits the per-function header and prints one compact line
// per impacted instruction as "<prefix> <file> <line>". Assert those
// syntactic-diff (-/+) and data-dependence (D) lines, and that the verbose
// "** helper **" header is absent (disallowed) -- exercising the
// header-omission branch and the compact instruction formatting.
